### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@organizationId = 1
@labId = 1
@csrfToken = replace-with-xsrf-cookie-value

### Get all labs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs

### Get labs by organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs?organizationId={{organizationId}}

### Search labs by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs?search=main

### Search labs by organization and name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs?organizationId={{organizationId}}&search=main

### Get lab by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs/{{labId}}

### Create lab
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/labs
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "organizationId": {{organizationId}},
  "name": "Main Chemistry Lab",
  "location": "Building A, Floor 2",
  "description": "Primary lab for chemical experiments"
}

### Create second lab
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/labs
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "organizationId": {{organizationId}},
  "name": "Microbiology Lab",
  "location": "Building B, Floor 1",
  "description": "Lab for microbiology research"
}

### Update lab
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/labs/{{labId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Main Chemistry Lab Updated",
  "location": "Building A, Floor 3",
  "description": "Updated lab description"
}

### Deactivate lab
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/labs/{{labId}}/deactivate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Activate lab
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/labs/{{labId}}/activate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Validation error: empty name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/labs
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "organizationId": {{organizationId}},
  "name": "",
  "location": "Building A",
  "description": "Invalid lab without name"
}

### Not found error
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/labs/999999
